{{Codex|Orokin elegance meets formidable stopping power in this exquisite revolver. Hits have a chance to maximize Ammo Efficiency for a few seconds.}}
'''Magnus Prime''' is the [[Prime]]d variant of the {{Weapon|Magnus}} heavy pistol, with improvements to its [[critical chance]], [[critical multiplier]], and [[status chance]], and slightly faster [[reload speed]]. Its shots also uniquely have a chance to grant it 100% [[Ammo Efficiency]] for a short duration. It was released alongside {{WF|Nidus Prime}} and {{Weapon|Strun Prime}}.

It is also a [[weapon crafting ingredient]] for {{Weapon|Akmagnus Prime}} (x2).
{{Checklist|nocategory=true|
* {{Weapon|Magnus Prime}} + {{Weapon|Magnus Prime}} → {{Weapon|Akmagnus Prime}}
}}

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Impact}} damage.
*Landing a successful hit (including from [[Multishot]]) or inflicting [[Status]] damage ({{D|Slash}}, {{D|Heat}}, {{D|Toxin}}, {{D|Electricity}}, and {{D|Gas}} procs) with Magnus Prime has a '''4%''' chance to grant the "'''Chamber Cascade'''" buff, increasing [[Ammo Efficiency]] by '''100%''' for '''4''' seconds and can be refreshed on subsequent shots.
*Can use the Magnus-exclusive {{M|Deadly Maneuvers}} mod.

{{Advantages|}}
{{Disadvantages|
*High [[recoil]].
*Has a slight horizontal recoil as well as vertical, which increases spread when fired quickly.
}}
